# Turtle-Seals, a french vanilla creature: cast with Black Lotus mana, its characteristics as printed (power, toughness,
# keywords, colors, types, protection), then attacking Bot2, who has no creatures.
# Vigilance (CR 702.20b): attacking doesn't tap it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus x2
Turtle-Seals
Plains x21

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#2.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Turtle-Seals.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.End]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Turtle-Seals.Power = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Turtle-Seals.Toughness = 4
? Bot1.Battlefield.Turtle-Seals.Keywords = Vigilance
